          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Visible attacks on energy and transport infrastructure that employ remotely guided or autonomous systems increase political pressure and produce concrete legislative proposals to tighten oversight of dual‑use AI and autonomy technologies." />
