          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tightening and broadening of sanctions on Russian energy and shipping increases legal, compliance and seizure risk for counterparties, causing traders and carriers to reroute, delay, or withhold cargoes that would otherwise transit Red Sea/Hormuz corridors." />
