          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained higher energy prices raise export revenues and cash reserves for energy-exporting firms and sovereign owners, enabling and financing greater corporate outbound investment and acquisitions abroad." />
