          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained spikes in global energy prices driven by the Russia–Ukraine war push headline (and eventually core) inflation higher, prompting central banks to raise policy rates to meet inflation targets and anchor expectations." />
