          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Large-scale rerouting increases transport costs and delivery uncertainty, raising working capital needs and trade‑finance utilisation and causing banks and markets to price higher lending spreads and reduced willingness to extend credit, thereby tightening financial conditions." />
          <attvalue for="37" value="0-6 months" />
