          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="An increase in official policy rates raises corporate discount rates and the cost of financing operational deployments, prompting firms to postpone or slow rollout of new models to conserve cash and reduce risk exposure." />
